services=[('investment-products','Investment products','Access a broad investment universe.','Explore traditional and alternative asset classes in the context of your objectives, investment horizon and appetite for risk.',['Public market investments','Structured solutions & derivatives','Private equity investments','Cash management solutions','Life and non-life insurance']),('investment-management','Investment management','A disciplined approach to your portfolio.','Bring expert advice, research and a global perspective to investment decisions, with a portfolio approach aligned to your goals.',['Investment objectives','Portfolio alignment','Ongoing investment conversations']),('financing','Financing','Liquidity, with your long-term plan in view.','Explore financing needs alongside your investments, so near-term priorities can be considered within your wider wealth strategy.',['Liquidity requirements','Your investment horizon','Financing within your wealth strategy']),('legacy-planning','Legacy planning','Plan for the wealth you pass on.','Start a structured conversation about succession and the transition of wealth across generations, guided by your family’s priorities.',['Family priorities','Succession objectives','Intergenerational continuity'])]
